#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to initialize your Qiskit Runtime account, instantiate your account, and"
" load saved credentials."
msgstr ""
"Cara memulakan akaun Qiskit Runtime anda, menjana contoh akaun anda, dan "
"memuatkan kelayakan yang disimpan."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize your Qiskit Runtime service account"
msgstr "Mulakan akaun perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime anda"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Initialize your Qiskit Runtime service account {#initialize-your-qiskit-"
"runtime-service-account}"
msgstr ""
"Mulakan akaun perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime anda {#initialize-your-qiskit-"
"runtime-service-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before using Qiskit Runtime, you have to initialize (instantiate) your "
"account by submitting (loading) credentials.  These credentials can be "
"manually submitted each time you initialize the Qiskit Runtime service, or "
"you can save them for reuse.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum menggunakan Qiskit Runtime, anda perlu memulakan (menjana contoh) "
"akaun anda dengan menghantar (memuatkan) kelayakan. Kelayakan ini boleh "
"dihantar secara manual setiap kali anda memulakan perkhidmatan Qiskit "
"Runtime, atau anda boleh menyimpannya untuk digunakan semula.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"      * Jika anda menggunakan komputer awam atau persekitaran yang tidak dipercayai yang lain, ikuti arahan dalam [Mulakan perkhidmatan dalam persekitaran yang tidak dipercayai](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"      * Ikuti [arahan ini](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) jika anda ingin menyambung menggunakan REST API dan bukannya menggunakan Qiskit.\n"
"      * Jika perlu, gunakan [maklumat ini](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) untuk mengkonfigurasi tembok api anda bagi membolehkan akses ke titik akhir API IBM Quantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum anda mula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that you have completed these steps:\n"
msgstr "Pastikan anda telah menyelesaikan langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ensure that you are a member of an IBM Cloud account.  See [Set up your IBM "
"Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan anda adalah ahli akaun IBM Cloud. Lihat [Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud "
"anda](/guides/cloud-setup) untuk arahan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create (or have access to) at least one instance. Follow these steps to "
"verify:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cipta (atau mempunyai akses kepada) sekurang-kurangnya satu instans. Ikuti "
"langkah-langkah ini untuk mengesahkan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Log masuk ke [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account "
"switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan akaun dan rantau yang betul dipilih dalam penukar akaun di "
"pengepala.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have one or more instances shown, you're done with this step. "
"Otherwise, [create an instance](/guides/instances#add-instance).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda mempunyai satu atau lebih instans yang ditunjukkan, anda telah "
"selesai dengan langkah ini. Jika tidak, [cipta "
"instans.](/guides/instances#add-instance)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [Qiskit SDK "
"and Qiskit Runtime installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan anda bekerja dalam persekitaran Python yang aktif dengan [SDK "
"Qiskit dan Qiskit Runtime dipasang.](/guides/install-qiskit#local)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual "
"environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan persekitaran maya Python dan jalankan Python dalam persekitaran "
"maya anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Cari kelayakan akses anda {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find your API key (also referred to as an  _API token_). From the "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy "
"it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. The token will"
" not be visible again. Note that you can use a single API key to connect to "
"any region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cari kunci API anda (juga dirujuk sebagai _token API_). Dari [papan "
"pemuka](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), cipta kunci API anda, kemudian "
"salin ke lokasi selamat supaya anda boleh menggunakannya untuk pengesahan "
"jati diri. Token tidak akan dapat dilihat lagi. Perhatikan bahawa anda boleh"
" menggunakan satu kunci API untuk menyambung ke mana-mana rantau.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its "
"CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can"
" use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilihan: Cari instans yang ingin anda gunakan dari halaman "
"[Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Arahkan kursor ke atas "
"CRN-nya, klik ikon untuk menyalinnya, kemudian simpan di lokasi selamat "
"supaya anda boleh menggunakannya untuk mengenal pasti instans.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Connect Qiskit with your Qiskit Runtime service instance {#connect-qiskit-"
"with-your-qiskit-runtime-service-instance}"
msgstr ""
"Sambungkan Qiskit dengan contoh perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime anda {#connect-"
"qiskit-with-your-qiskit-runtime-service-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"These instructions are designed for `qiskit_ibm_runtime` v0.42 or later. Some features are not enabled in earlier versions of `qiskit_ibm_runtime`. In these cases, you should always provide a value for `channel`, `token`, and `instance`, either explicitly or through a saved account.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Arahan ini direka untuk `qiskit_ibm_runtime` v0.42 atau lebih baharu. Sesetengah ciri tidak diaktifkan dalam versi `qiskit_ibm_runtime` yang lebih lama. Dalam kes ini, anda harus sentiasa memberikan nilai untuk `channel`, `token`, dan `instance`, sama ada secara eksplisit atau melalui akaun yang disimpan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The basic code to connect Qiskit with your Qiskit Runtime service instance "
"follows.  However, there are several different ways to customize the "
"`QiskitRuntimeService` options, depending on your needs.  These options are "
"described in the following sections.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod asas untuk menyambungkan Qiskit dengan contoh perkhidmatan Qiskit "
"Runtime anda adalah seperti berikut. Walau bagaimanapun, terdapat beberapa "
"cara berbeza untuk menyesuaikan pilihan `QiskitRuntimeService`, bergantung "
"pada keperluan anda. Pilihan ini diterangkan dalam bahagian berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The default channel is `ibm_quantum_platform`.  Because this is almost always the appropriate channel, it is not included in the examples.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Saluran lalai adalah `ibm_quantum_platform`. Oleh kerana ini hampir selalu merupakan saluran yang sesuai, ia tidak dimasukkan dalam contoh-contoh.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"explicit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"explicit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quick start path: Specify credentials explicitly {#quick-start-path-specify-"
"credentials-explicitly}"
msgstr ""
"Laluan permulaan pantas: Tentukan kelayakan secara eksplisit {#quick-start-"
"path-specify-credentials-explicitly}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The fastest way to get a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance running is the "
"direct instantiation method: explicitly provide the API token (key) and CRN "
"(instance identifier) every time you need to initialize the Qiskit Runtime "
"service. See [Find your access credentials](#access-credentials) if "
"necessary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara paling pantas untuk mendapatkan contoh `QiskitRuntimeService` yang "
"berjalan adalah kaedah instansi terus: berikan token API (kunci) dan CRN "
"(pengecam instans) secara eksplisit setiap kali anda perlu memulakan "
"perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime. Lihat [Cari kelayakan akses anda](#access-"
"credentials) jika perlu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This path is reliable but can be tedious if you need to load the same "
"details repeatedly. To avoid loading your credentials multiple times, if you"
" are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop "
"or workstation), you can use saved account credentials, as described in the "
"following section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Laluan ini boleh dipercayai tetapi boleh membosankan jika anda perlu "
"memuatkan butiran yang sama berulang kali. Untuk mengelakkan memuatkan "
"kelayakan beberapa kali, jika anda bekerja dalam persekitaran Python yang "
"dipercayai (seperti pada komputer riba atau stesen kerja peribadi), anda "
"boleh menggunakan kelayakan akaun yang disimpan, seperti yang diterangkan "
"dalam bahagian berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Although the `instance` input parameter is optional, it is recommended that "
"you always provide this information, unless you want to use a single service"
" to work with several instances. In this situation, see the [automatic "
"instance selection](#auto-select) section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Walaupun parameter input `instance` adalah pilihan, adalah disyorkan agar "
"anda sentiasa memberikan maklumat ini, melainkan anda ingin menggunakan satu"
" perkhidmatan untuk bekerja dengan beberapa instans. Dalam situasi ini, "
"lihat bahagian [pemilihan instans automatik](#auto-select).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"saved\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"saved\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quick start path: Specify saved credentials {#quick-start-path-specify-"
"saved-credentials}"
msgstr ""
"Laluan permulaan pantas: Tentukan kelayakan yang disimpan {#quick-start-"
"path-specify-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have already saved your credentials, use the following code to apply "
"your default credentials. For instructions to save credentials, see [Save "
"your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda telah menyimpan kelayakan anda, gunakan kod berikut untuk "
"menggunakan kelayakan lalai anda. Untuk arahan menyimpan kelayakan, lihat "
"[Simpan kelayakan akses anda.](/guides/save-credentials)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you named one or more sets of credentials - for example, for open and "
"premium access - use the following code to use a set of named credentials.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda menamakan satu atau lebih set kelayakan - sebagai contoh, untuk "
"akses terbuka dan premium - gunakan kod berikut untuk menggunakan set "
"kelayakan yang dinamakan.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Considerations when loading saved credentials {#considerations-when-loading-"
"saved-credentials}"
msgstr ""
"Pertimbangan apabila memuatkan kelayakan yang disimpan {#considerations-"
"when-loading-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you initialize a service with `token` and `name`, the `token` is ignored "
"and the saved details from the `name` account are loaded.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda memulakan perkhidmatan dengan `token` dan `name`, `token` "
"diabaikan dan butiran yang disimpan dari akaun `name` dimuatkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In the following example, the service loads the details from `account_A`"
" and does not use `token_B`:\n"
msgstr ""
"    Dalam contoh berikut, perkhidmatan memuatkan butiran dari `account_A` "
"dan tidak menggunakan `token_B`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(token=\"token_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you provide a `name` and an `instance` when initializing a service, the service tries to load the `name` account **and** connect to the specified `instance`. If there is any conflict, a warning is raised.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(token=\"token_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Jika anda memberikan `name` dan `instance` apabila memulakan perkhidmatan, perkhidmatan cuba memuatkan akaun `name` **dan** menyambung ke `instance` yang ditentukan. Jika terdapat konflik, amaran akan dikeluarkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In the following example, the service tries to load the credentials for "
"`account_A` and use instance `CRN_B` - even if there is a different instance"
" specified in `account_A`:\n"
msgstr ""
"    Dalam contoh berikut, perkhidmatan cuba memuatkan kelayakan untuk "
"`account_A` dan menggunakan instans `CRN_B` - walaupun terdapat instans "
"berbeza yang ditentukan dalam `account_A`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- The service tries to load the default saved account only if you don't provide a `token` or `name` when initializing a service.  However, if an `instance` is provided explicitly, the service tries to connect to that instance by using the default credentials. If there is any conflict, a warning is raised.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Perkhidmatan cuba memuatkan akaun yang disimpan lalai hanya jika anda tidak memberikan `token` atau `name` apabila memulakan perkhidmatan. Walau bagaimanapun, jika `instance` diberikan secara eksplisit, perkhidmatan cuba menyambung ke instans tersebut menggunakan kelayakan lalai. Jika terdapat konflik, amaran akan dikeluarkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In the following example, the service tries to load the default "
"credentials and use the instance `CRN_B` - even if there is a different "
"instance specified in the default account:\n"
msgstr ""
"    Dalam contoh berikut, perkhidmatan cuba memuatkan kelayakan lalai dan "
"menggunakan instans `CRN_B` - walaupun terdapat instans berbeza yang "
"ditentukan dalam akaun lalai:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you save multiple sets of credentials but don't specify one when initializing the service and there is no default saved account, the one whose name comes last alphabetically is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Jika anda menyimpan beberapa set kelayakan tetapi tidak menentukan satu apabila memulakan perkhidmatan dan tiada akaun lalai yang disimpan, kelayakan yang namanya terakhir mengikut abjad digunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In the following example, the user saved accounts named \"my_premium\" "
"and \"my_open\" but didn't mark either as the dfault.  They then initialized"
" the service by using the following code. In this case, the \"my_premium\" "
"credentials are used:\n"
msgstr ""
"    Dalam contoh berikut, pengguna menyimpan akaun bernama \"my_premium\" "
"dan \"my_open\" tetapi tidak menanda sama ada sebagai lalai. Mereka kemudian"
" memulakan perkhidmatan menggunakan kod berikut. Dalam kes ini, kelayakan "
"\"my_premium\" digunakan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you are persistently getting the error \"401 Unauthorized\", you might be trying to use a [bearer token](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment) instead of your API key.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Jika anda terus mendapat ralat \"401 Tidak Dibenarkan\", anda mungkin cuba menggunakan [token pembawa](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment) dan bukannya kunci API anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically select the instance {#automatically-select-the-instance}"
msgstr "Pilih instans secara automatik {#automatically-select-the-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you provide a token but **don't provide an instance CRN** when "
"instantiating the service, `QiskitRuntimeService` authenticates to the "
"account identified by the token and uses automatic instance selection to "
"choose the most relevant instance for the requested task. If you have "
"several instances available within your account, the service automatically "
"chooses from the available instances, depending on the resource requested "
"and these `QiskitRuntimeService` options (if set): `plans_preference`, "
"`region`, `tags`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda memberikan token tetapi **tidak memberikan CRN instans** apabila "
"menjana contoh perkhidmatan, `QiskitRuntimeService` mengesahkan jati diri ke"
" akaun yang dikenal pasti oleh token dan menggunakan pemilihan instans "
"automatik untuk memilih instans yang paling relevan untuk tugas yang "
"diminta. Jika anda mempunyai beberapa instans yang tersedia dalam akaun "
"anda, perkhidmatan secara automatik memilih dari instans yang tersedia, "
"bergantung pada sumber yang diminta dan pilihan `QiskitRuntimeService` ini "
"(jika ditetapkan): `plans_preference`, `region`, `tags`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`plans_preference`**: The types of instance plans to prioritize. For "
"example, if [`open`] is passed in, only Open Plan instances are available. "
"Accepted values are `open`, `premium`, `pay-as-you-go`, `flex`, and `on-"
"prem`. If `plans_preference` is not specified, free plans are prioritized "
"over paid plans.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`plans_preference`**: Jenis pelan instans untuk diutamakan. Sebagai "
"contoh, jika [`open`] dimasukkan, hanya instans Pelan Terbuka yang tersedia."
" Nilai yang diterima adalah `open`, `premium`, `pay-as-you-go`, `flex`, dan "
"`on-prem`. Jika `plans_preference` tidak ditentukan, pelan percuma "
"diutamakan berbanding pelan berbayar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`region`**: The instance region. Accepted values are `us-east` and `eu-"
"de`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`region`**: Rantau instans. Nilai yang diterima adalah `us-east` dan `eu-"
"de`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`tags`**: The instance tags. Accepts a list of tag name strings.\n"
msgstr "**`tags`**: Tag instans. Menerima senarai rentetan nama tag.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You can set up your [saved credentials](/guides/save-credentials) to automatically select an instance.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Anda boleh menyediakan [kelayakan yang disimpan](/guides/save-credentials) untuk memilih instans secara automatik.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The instance is found and used in this order:\n"
msgstr "Instans ditemui dan digunakan dalam urutan ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If your account only has access to one instance, it is selected by "
"default.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika akaun anda hanya mempunyai akses kepada satu instans, instans tersebut "
"dipilih secara lalai.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If saved credentials are being used and an instance was specified with the "
"credentials, that instance is used. See [Considerations when loading saved "
"credentials](#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kelayakan yang disimpan digunakan dan instans telah ditentukan dengan "
"kelayakan tersebut, instans itu digunakan. Lihat [Pertimbangan apabila "
"memuatkan kelayakan yang disimpan.](#considerations-when-loading-saved-"
"credentials)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If your account has multiple instances that can access the requested QPU, "
"the system uses your specified plan preferences to choose a plan and "
"instance. For Qiskit Runtime v0.42 and later, free plans are prioritized by "
"default.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika akaun anda mempunyai beberapa instans yang boleh mengakses QPU yang "
"diminta, sistem menggunakan keutamaan pelan yang anda tentukan untuk memilih"
" pelan dan instans. Untuk Qiskit Runtime v0.42 dan lebih baharu, pelan "
"percuma diutamakan secara lalai.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If your account has access to multiple instances but only one can access the"
" requested QPU, the instance with access is selected. If this instance is "
"not associated with a free plan, a cost will be incurred.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika akaun anda mempunyai akses ke beberapa instans tetapi hanya satu yang "
"boleh mengakses QPU yang diminta, instans yang mempunyai akses dipilih. Jika"
" instans ini tidak dikaitkan dengan pelan percuma, kos akan ditanggung.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Examples {#examples}"
msgstr "Contoh {#examples}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to "
"the account to find ones that can access the specified backend:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, perkhidmatan mencari semua instans yang tersedia untuk "
"akaun bagi mencari yang boleh mengakses Backend yang ditentukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to "
"the account in the EU region to find ones that can access the specified "
"backend:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, perkhidmatan mencari semua instans yang tersedia untuk "
"akaun di rantau EU bagi mencari yang boleh mengakses Backend yang "
"ditentukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to "
"the account and are tagged as `services` to find ones that can access the "
"specified backend:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, perkhidmatan mencari semua instans yang tersedia untuk "
"akaun dan ditag sebagai `services` bagi mencari yang boleh mengakses Backend"
" yang ditentukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, the service searches all premium and open instances that "
"are available to the account to find ones that can access the specified "
"backend. If a backend is in both a Premium and an Open Plan instance, the "
"Premium Plan instance is prioritized because `premium` is specified first in"
" `plans_preference`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, perkhidmatan mencari semua instans premium dan terbuka "
"yang tersedia untuk akaun bagi mencari yang boleh mengakses Backend yang "
"ditentukan. Jika Backend terdapat dalam instans Pelan Premium dan Terbuka, "
"instans Pelan Premium diutamakan kerana `premium` ditentukan dahulu dalam "
"`plans_preference`.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Determine which instance was chosen {#determine-which-instance-was-chosen}"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan instans mana yang dipilih {#determine-which-instance-was-chosen}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The selected instance is returned as a warning. Additionally, you can run "
"`service.active_instance()` to determine the active instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Instans yang dipilih dikembalikan sebagai amaran. Selain itu, anda boleh "
"menjalankan `service.active_instance()` untuk menentukan instans yang "
"aktif.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Local testing with Qiskit Runtime {#local-testing-with-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr ""
"Ujian tempatan dengan Qiskit Runtime {#local-testing-with-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `QiskitRuntimeService` class can be initialized with `channel=local` to "
"perform local simulation. In this case, authentication is not required and "
"there is no need to provide values for `token` or `instance`. Therefore, it "
"is not recommended that you save a local account.  Instead, you can do "
"direct instantiation:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelas `QiskitRuntimeService` boleh dimulakan dengan `channel=local` untuk "
"melakukan simulasi tempatan. Dalam kes ini, pengesahan jati diri tidak "
"diperlukan dan tiada keperluan untuk memberikan nilai untuk `token` atau "
"`instance`. Oleh itu, adalah tidak disyorkan untuk menyimpan akaun tempatan."
" Sebaliknya, anda boleh melakukan instansi terus:\n"

